  "worked_solution": "The function is continuous on the open intervals $(0,4.4)$, $(4.4,7.7)$ and $(7.7,\\infty ).$\n\nAdditionally, the function is right-continuous at $x=0.$ Hence, it is continuous on the interval $[0,4.4).$\n\nTherefore, we can say that the function is continuous on $x\\in [0,4.4)\\cup (4.4,7.7)\\cup (7.7,\\infty ).$",
